pe": "jd_task", "children": [{"id": "r2-33", "type": "p", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "1. 釐清前端功能、使用情境及驗收範圍。"}]}, {"id": "task1-description", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "與專案經理及客戶窗口確認網站需要支援的主要操作、裝置、瀏覽器與關鍵異常情境，整理開發範圍及尚待確認的事項。"}]}, {"id": "f03-task-1-outcomes", "type": "jd_outcomes", "children": [{"id": "r2-38", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-35", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-34", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "主要產出："}, {"text": "可供開發與確認的前端需求及驗收範圍紀錄。"}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-1-requirements", "type": "jd_requirements", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-1-requirements-list", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-37", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-36", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "完成要求："}, {"text": "已確認與尚未確認的內容可以區分；不把推測直接當作客戶同意的需求。"}]}]}]}]}], "source_refs": ["fixture-source:task-1"]}, {"id": "task-2", "type": "jd_task", "children": [{"id": "r2-39", "type": "p", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "2. 評估前端工作量、依賴條件及需求變更的影響。"}]}, {"id": "task2-description", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "依工作範圍評估開發投入，辨識後端介面等依賴，說明變更對既有功能及交付安排的影響，提供調整建議。"}]}, {"id": "f03-task-2-outcomes", "type": "jd_outcomes", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-2-empty-outcome", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": ""}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-2-requirements", "type": "jd_requirements", "children": [{"id": "r2-42", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-41", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-40", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "完成要求："}, {"text": "估算包含必要前提與限制；新增或變更工作由專案經理協調確認後納入安排，不自行承諾報價或客戶期限。"}]}]}]}]}], "source_refs": ["fixture-source:task-2"]}]}, {"id": "duty-2", "type": "jd_duty", "children": [{"id": "r2-43", "type": "h3", "children": [{"text": "二、開發網站前端與整合資料介面"}]}, {"id": "task-3", "type": "jd_task", "children": [{"id": "r2-44", "type": "p", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "3. 實作網站頁面、版面及互動功能。"}]}, {"id": "task3-description", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "依已確認的需求與視覺設計開發前端，處理約定裝置與瀏覽器的差異，讓主要操作符合預期。"}]}, {"id": "f03-task-3-outcomes", "type": "jd_outcomes", "children": [{"id": "r2-49", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-46", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-45", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "主要產出："}, {"text": "可供整合與檢查的前端頁面及程式版本。"}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-3-requirements", "type": "jd_requirements", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-3-requirements-list", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-48", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-47", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "完成要求："}, {"text": "主要操作、約定的鍵盤操作與基本可用性要求納入實作；發現設計與需求不一致時，先確認再調整。"}]}]}]}]}], "source_refs": ["fixture-source:task-3"]}, {"id": "task-4", "type": "jd_task", "children": [{"id": "r2-50", "type": "p", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "4. 串接後端介面，處理資料與各種操作狀態。"}]}, {"id": "task4-description", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "依介面約定實作資料顯示，以及載入、成功、失敗、逾時等情境的前端行為，並與後端工程師釐清問題及責任範圍。"}]}, {"id": "f03-task-4-outcomes", "type": "jd_outcomes", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-4-empty-outcome", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": ""}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-4-requirements", "type": "jd_requirements", "children": [{"id": "r2-60", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-59", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-51", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "完成要求："}]}, {"id": "r2-58", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-53", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-52", "type": "lic", "children": [{"text": "查詢逾時時，保留必要輸入並提供重試方式。"}]}]}, {"id": "r2-55", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-54", "type": "lic", "children": [{"text": "訂單送出結果不明時，避免使用者重複送出，並與後端確認實際狀態，不直接判定下單失敗。"}]}]}, {"id": "r2-57", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-56", "type": "lic", "children": [{"text": "涉及後端資料或業務規則時，與負責人員確認，不自行改定規則。"}]}]}]}]}]}]}], "skill_ids": ["f03-jd_skill-3", "f03-jd_skill-4"], "source_refs": ["fixture-source:task-4"], "knowledge_ids": []}]}, {"id": "duty-3", "type": "jd_duty", "children": [{"id": "r2-61", "type": "h3", "children": [{"text": "三、確認品質與完成交付"}]}, {"id": "task-5", "type": "jd_task", "children": [{"id": "r2-62", "type": "p", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "5. 檢查前端功能，修正並驗證交付前的缺陷。"}]}, {"id": "task5-description", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "檢查主要使用流程、約定的異常情境，以及裝置與瀏覽器的支援情況；記錄問題、修正前端缺陷並確認相關影響。"}]}, {"id": "f03-task-5-outcomes", "type": "jd_outcomes", "children": [{"id": "r2-67", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-64", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-63", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "主要產出："}, {"text": "檢查結果、缺陷處理紀錄及待解限制說明。"}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-5-requirements", "type": "jd_requirements", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-5-requirements-list", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-66", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-65", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "完成要求："}, {"text": "修正後確認原問題及受影響操作；未解事項交由專案經理協調，不自行宣稱已通過客戶驗收。"}]}]}]}]}], "source_refs": ["fixture-source:task-5"]}, {"id": "task-6", "type": "jd_task", "children": [{"id": "r2-68", "type": "p", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "6. 準備前端交付內容，配合發布、驗收與維護交接。"}]}, {"id": "task6-description", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "整理可辨識的交付版本、操作或維護說明、已知限制及交接事項，並配合處理發布過程中的前端問題。"}]}, {"id": "f03-task-6-outcomes", "type": "jd_outcomes", "children": [{"id": "r2-73", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-70", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-69", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "主要產出："}, {"text": "交付版本及接收者可使用的交接說明。"}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-6-requirements", "type": "jd_requirements", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-6-requirements-list", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-72", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-71", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "完成要求："}, {"text": "交付版本與檢查結果一致；發布問題能提供重現資訊；涉及服務端部署時，與負責該部署的後端工程師協作。客戶驗收仍由客戶確認。"}]}]}]}]}], "source_refs": ["fixture-source:task-6"]}]}, {"id": "duty-4", "type": "jd_duty", "children": [{"id": "r2-74", "type": "h3", "children": [{"text": "四、處理上線問題與約定維護"}]}, {"id": "task-7", "type": "jd_task", "children": [{"id": "r2-75", "type": "p", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "7. 處理約定範圍內的上線後前端問題。"}]}, {"id": "task7-description", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "收到問題後，了解影響與重現條件，區分前端缺陷、後端問題或新增需求；依判斷進行修正、驗證或轉交適當人員。"}]}, {"id": "r2-80", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-77", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-76", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "執行時機："}, {"text": "上線後發生屬於服務範圍的問題時，包含少見但影響主要操作的異常。"}]}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-7-outcomes", "type": "jd_outcomes", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-7-empty-outcome", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": ""}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-7-requirements", "type": "jd_requirements", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-7-requirements-list", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-79", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-78", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "完成要求："}, {"text": "記錄處理結果與未解事項；未排除的問題不能標成已解決。處理優先順序及對外承諾由專案經理協調。"}]}]}]}]}], "skill_ids": ["f03-jd_skill-3"], "source_refs": ["fixture-source:task-7"], "knowledge_ids": ["f03-jd_knowledge-2"]}, {"id": "task-8", "type": "jd_task", "children": [{"id": "r2-81", "type": "p", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "8. 依維護約定執行定期前端檢查。"}]}, {"id": "task8-description", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "對包含定期維護的專案，檢查主要前端操作，記錄結果並追蹤已知問題或必要調整。"}]}, {"id": "r2-88", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-83", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-82", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "執行時機："}, {"text": "依各案約定；目前包含月檢服務的專案按月執行。"}]}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-8-outcomes", "type": "jd_outcomes", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-8-outcomes-list", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-85", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-84", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "主要產出："}, {"text": "維護檢查及問題追蹤紀錄。"}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "f03-task-8-requirements", "type": "jd_requirements", "children": [{"id": "f03-task-8-requirements-list", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-87", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-86", "type": "lic", "children": [{"bold": true, "text": "完成要求："}, {"text": "僅約定交付後缺陷修正的專案，不自動納入固定月檢；超出服務範圍的新增需求另行確認。"}]}]}]}]}], "skill_ids": ["f03-jd_skill-5"], "source_refs": ["fixture-source:task-8"], "knowledge_ids": ["f03-jd_knowledge-5"]}]}], "section_kind": "work"}, {"id": "section-knowledge", "type": "jd_section", "children": [{"id": "r2-89", "type": "h2", "children": [{"text": "所需知識"}]}, {"id": "r2-90", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "知識範圍"}]}, {"id": "r2-92", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "工作上的用途"}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_knowledge-1", "type": "jd_knowledge", "children": [{"id": "r2-95", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "網頁結構、樣式、互動程式與瀏覽器運作"}]}, {"id": "r2-97", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "理解頁面實作、裝置差異及前端行為問題"}]}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_knowledge-2", "type": "jd_knowledge", "children": [{"id": "r2-100", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "前後端介面契約、資料格式與非同步狀態"}]}, {"id": "r2-102", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "理解資料串接、載入與錯誤情境，釐清前後端責任"}]}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_knowledge-3", "type": "jd_knowledge", "children": [{"id": "r2-105", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "基本可用性與約定的鍵盤操作要求"}]}, {"id": "r2-107", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "辨識會阻礙使用者完成主要操作的問題"}]}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_knowledge-4", "type": "jd_knowledge", "children": [{"id": "r2-110", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "軟體測試、缺陷追蹤與版本控管"}]}, {"id": "r2-112", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "支援功能檢查、修正驗證及交付版本辨識"}]}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_knowledge-5", "type": "jd_knowledge", "children": [{"id": "r2-115", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "專案範圍、驗收及維護約定"}]}, {"id": "r2-117", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "判斷工作是否在服務範圍內，辨識需要再確認的需求"}]}]}], "section_kind": "knowledge"}, {"id": "section-skills", "type": "jd_section", "children": [{"id": "r2-120", "type": "h2", "children": [{"text": "所需技能"}]}, {"id": "r2-121", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "技能"}]}, {"id": "r2-123", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "具體內涵"}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_skill-1", "type": "jd_skill", "children": [{"id": "r2-126", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "需求澄清與工作評估"}]}, {"id": "r2-128", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "將模糊要求轉成可確認的操作情境；評估工作量、介面依賴與變更影響，說明估算前提"}]}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_skill-2", "type": "jd_skill", "children": [{"id": "r2-131", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "前端開發與調整"}]}, {"id": "r2-133", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "運用網頁技術實現設計與互動，依約定的裝置及操作方式調整頁面"}]}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_skill-3", "type": "jd_skill", "children": [{"id": "r2-136", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "介面整合與問題診斷"}]}, {"id": "r2-138", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "處理資料及非同步狀態，運用重現步驟、瀏覽器檢查與介面資料定位問題"}]}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_skill-4", "type": "jd_skill", "children": [{"id": "r2-141", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "測試與修正驗證"}]}, {"id": "r2-143", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "從主要操作及失敗情境安排檢查，確認修正效果與相關影響"}]}]}, {"id": "f03-jd_skill-5", "type": "jd_skill", "children": [{"id": "r2-146", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "技術協作與交接"}]}, {"id": "r2-148", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "辨識交付版本，向協作者說明依賴、限制及處理結果，留下可供接手的資訊"}]}]}], "section_kind": "skills"}, {"id": "section-conditions", "type": "jd_section", "children": [{"id": "r2-151", "type": "h2", "children": [{"text": "工作條件與責任邊界"}]}, {"id": "r2-160", "type": "ul", "children": [{"id": "r2-153", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-152", "type": "lic", "children": [{"text": "日常以電腦開發、檢查及線上協調為主，依專案安排工作；本職位無固定輪班或例行出差。"}]}]}, {"id": "r2-155", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-154", "type": "lic", "children": [{"text": "本人負責前端技術處理與建議，不承擔人員管理。專案經理協調優先順序、工作範圍及對外承諾。"}]}]}, {"id": "r2-157", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-156", "type": "lic", "children": [{"text": "商務開發、報價、簽約及帳務不屬本職位；視覺設計、後端業務規則、服務端部署及一般客服由相應人員負責。"}]}]}, {"id": "r2-159", "type": "li", "children": [{"id": "r2-158", "type": "lic", "children": [{"text": "維護依各案服務範圍及周期執行，不因此包含全天候值班或未約定的回應時限。"}]}]}]}], "section_kind": "conditions"}, {"id": "r2-161", "type": "hr", "children": [{"text": ""}]}, {"id": "r2-162", "type": "p", "children": [{"text": "樣稿編製日：2026-09-09；閱讀版 r2。內容完整性限於本樣稿明示的虛構工作範圍；不是跨職位通用任務清單，也不是個人能力評分。"}]}], "created_at": "2026-09-10 00:20:36.652229+00:00"}], "jd_operation": [{"d